         <div class="container news-events bg-white">
            <div class="py-3">
               <div class="row">
                  <div class="col-12 col-md-8">
                     <section class="article-listing news-row">
                        <h2>MCC Headlines</h2>
                        <p class="more-link"><a href="/news/index.html" class="btn btn-sm more-arrow">See more News</a></p>
                        <div class="slick-slider flex-items"><article class="news-article">	<div class="image-container"> <a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/lead-session_mark-thomas_november-2026.html"> <img src="https://meridiancc.edu/news/leadnov260.png" alt="" /> </a> </div><div class="article-info-container">	<p class="datetime"><time datetime="Monday, November 16th, 2026">Monday, November 16th, 2026</time></p>	<h3 class="h4"><a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/lead-session_mark-thomas_november-2026.html">MCC alumnus encourages students to learn from failure, set goals for success</a></h3>	<p class="description">MCC alumnus Mark Thomas encouraged students to turn setbacks into opportunities during a recent LEAD session. His talk, "How to Handle Failure and Use SMART Goals to Succeed," offered practical steps for reaching goals.</p>	<p><a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/lead-session_mark-thomas_november-2026.html" class="more-arrow">Read More</a></p></div></article><article class="news-article">	<div class="image-container"> <a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/mcc-lunch-with-legends_2026.html"> <img src="https://meridiancc.edu/news/legends20260.png" alt="" /> </a> </div><div class="article-info-container">	<p class="datetime"><time datetime="Sunday, November 15th, 2026">Sunday, November 15th, 2026</time></p>	<h3 class="h4"><a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/mcc-lunch-with-legends_2026.html">MCC honors military service at Lunch with Legends</a></h3>	<p class="description">MCC's Lunch with Legends honored current and former military members during the college's Military Appreciation Week. Col. Robert Brady, commander of the 186th Air Refueling Wing at Key Field Air National Guard Base was the guest speaker.</p>	<p><a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/mcc-lunch-with-legends_2026.html" class="more-arrow">Read More</a></p></div></article><article class="news-article">	<div class="image-container"> <a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/mcc-veterans-day-program-2026.html"> <img src="https://meridiancc.edu/news/veteransday202602.png" alt="" /> </a> </div><div class="article-info-container">	<p class="datetime"><time datetime="Sunday, November 15th, 2026">Sunday, November 15th, 2026</time></p>	<h3 class="h4"><a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/mcc-veterans-day-program-2026.html">Veterans Day program highlights service beyond the uniform</a></h3>	<p class="description">Meridian Community College's annual Veterans Day program honored veterans and their families through music, remarks and a roll of honor recognizing each military branch.</p>	<p><a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/mcc-veterans-day-program-2026.html" class="more-arrow">Read More</a></p></div></article><article class="news-article">	<div class="image-container"> <a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/organization-of-student-nurses-meeting_2026.html"> <img src="https://meridiancc.edu/news/osn20260.png" alt="" /> </a> </div><div class="article-info-container">	<p class="datetime"><time datetime="Sunday, November 15th, 2026">Sunday, November 15th, 2026</time></p>	<h3 class="h4"><a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/organization-of-student-nurses-meeting_2026.html">Guest speaker discusses suicide prevention with MCC nursing students</a></h3>	<p class="description">Meridian Community College Associate Degree Nursing students were reminded of the importance of mental health support and suicide prevention during the Organization of Student Nurses (OSN) meeting.</p>	<p><a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/organization-of-student-nurses-meeting_2026.html" class="more-arrow">Read More</a></p></div></article><article class="news-article">	<div class="image-container"> <a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/ms-rural-physicians-dentists_2026.html"> <img src="https://meridiancc.edu/news/msrural20260.png" alt="" /> </a> </div><div class="article-info-container">	<p class="datetime"><time datetime="Sunday, November 15th, 2026">Sunday, November 15th, 2026</time></p>	<h3 class="h4"><a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/ms-rural-physicians-dentists_2026.html">Cook shares health career opportunities with MCC students</a></h3>	<p class="description">Dr. Cook, senior director of the Mississippi Rural Physicians Scholarship Program and Mississippi Rural Dentists Scholarship Program, discussed scholarships, mentoring, and hands-on learning opportunities during an on-campus information session.</p>	<p><a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/ms-rural-physicians-dentists_2026.html" class="more-arrow">Read More</a></p></div></article><article class="news-article">	<div class="image-container"> <a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/mcc-foundation_annual-membership-celebration_2026.html"> <img src="https://meridiancc.edu/news/mccfoundation26-0.png" alt="" /> </a> </div><div class="article-info-container">	<p class="datetime"><time datetime="Sunday, November 15th, 2026">Sunday, November 15th, 2026</time></p>	<h3 class="h4"><a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/mcc-foundation_annual-membership-celebration_2026.html">MCC Foundation Celebration honors donors</a></h3>	<p class="description">The MCC Foundation hosted its annual membership celebration at Northwood Country Club, recognizing donors and highlighting growth. The Foundation received more than $1.4 million this year in contributions, grants and gifts in kind, an increase of more than 8 percent over the previous year.</p>	<p><a href="https://meridiancc.edu/news/mcc-foundation_annual-membership-celebration_2026.html" class="more-arrow">Read More</a></p></div></article></div>
                     </section>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
                     <section class="event-listing">
                        <h2>Upcoming Events<span class="px-1 xxl far fa-calendar-check" aria-hidden="true"></span></h2>
                        <div class="event-feed"><div class="event">	<div class="event-date">		<a href="https://meridiancc.edu/calendar/_dev/index.html#event-details/53d8cc79-b8bc-4d16-944c-694701e03135">			<span class="month">NOV</span><span class="day">18</span>		</a>	</div>	<div class="event-content">	<p class="event-time">11:00 AM - 12:00 PM</p> 		<p>			<a href="https://meridiancc.edu/calendar/_dev/index.html#event-details/53d8cc79-b8bc-4d16-944c-694701e03135">Grief Share Lunch & Learn</a>			<span class="event-short-desc">Reserve your spot for...</span>		</p> 			<p>				<span class="event-location">MCC Foundation Chapel</span>			</p>	</div></div><div class="event">	<div class="event-date">		<a href="https://meridiancc.edu/calendar/_dev/index.html#event-details/3ca36922-dccc-46a6-b950-089187d5e309">			<span class="month">NOV</span><span class="day">23</span>		</a>	</div>	<div class="event-content">	<p class="event-time">12:00 AM - 12:00 AM</p> 		<p>			<a href="https://meridiancc.edu/calendar/_dev/index.html#event-details/3ca36922-dccc-46a6-b950-089187d5e309">Thanksgiving Break - Campus Closed</a>			<span class="event-short-desc">Meridian Community College...</span>		</p>	</div></div><div class="event">	<div class="event-date">		<a href="https://meridiancc.edu/calendar/_dev/index.html#event-details/d8a9b363-2a9c-40a3-bbde-109baa1ec1fb">			<span class="month">NOV</span><span class="day">30</span>		</a>	</div>	<div class="event-content">	<p class="event-time">1:00 PM - 2:00 PM</p> 		<p>			<a href="https://meridiancc.edu/calendar/_dev/index.html#event-details/d8a9b363-2a9c-40a3-bbde-109baa1ec1fb">Creative Writing Group</a>			<span class="event-short-desc">Come practice your creative...</span>		</p> 			<p>				<span class="event-location">L.O. Todd/Billy C. Beal Student Success Center</span>			</p>	</div></div></div>
